    "remediation": {
      "description": "Enable forceRemoteSettingsRefresh in managed settings to ensure the CLI always starts with the latest policy. Combine with sandbox.failIfUnavailable for defense-in-depth. For air-gapped environments, maintain a local managed-settings.json as fallback.",
      "code_example": "// managed-settings.json (enterprise deployment)\n{\n  \"forceRemoteSettingsRefresh\": true,\n  \"sandbox\": { \"failIfUnavailable\": true },\n  \"disableSkillShellExecution\": true,\n  \"allowedChannelPlugins\": [\"sentinel\"]\n}",
