    80	   # b. Stage the EIR explicitly (don't rely on "git add -A" — templates are gitignored, EIR-*.md uses a negation rule).
    81	   Bash: git add reports/archive/EIR-{date}.json reports/archive/EIR-{date}.md
    82	   # c. Stage the files touched by applied recommendations (SKILL.md edits, config JSON, scripts, etc.). Use "git add -u" to pick up only modifications — never stage untracked files blindly.
